  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "At present, the upload form for adding binary resources to Fedora 6 does not include a mechanism for specifying a mime type, so they always go in as octet-streams. It would be nice to be able to more easily specify the content type up front.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
